---
import Specimen from '../Specimen.astro';
---
<Specimen title="Site header" surface="none">
    <Fragment slot="notes">
        <p>The header at the top of this page is the live component: a thin, translucent bar with the logo, the main navigation, the theme switch, and the brand swatches along its bottom edge, filling as the page scrolls.</p>
        <p>On phones, the navigation moves into a menu opened by the button on the right, which works without JavaScript.</p>
    </Fragment>
    <p class="muted">See the top of the page.</p>
</Specimen>

<Specimen title="Footer" surface="none">
    <Fragment slot="notes">
        <p>The footer at the bottom of this page is the live component: a directory of the site with products, company and resources, the social links and the copyright line.</p>
        <p>People aren't listed in the footer; they live on the About page. The capstone products join the Products column once their pages exist.</p>
    </Fragment>
    <p class="muted">See the bottom of the page.</p>
</Specimen>
